    "durationMs": 156682,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and fully verified. Here's what I built:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `database/migrations/2026_11_21_000000_create_links_table.php` — `links` table with a unique `code` (case-sensitive `utf8mb4_bin` collation), `url`, `clicks`, timestamps\n- `app/Models/Link.php` + `app/Http/Controllers/LinkController.php` — Eloquent persistence, validation via `Rule::url()->protocols(['http','https'])` and a `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}$` code rule, collision-safe code generation, atomic `increment('clicks')` for redirects, and duplicate-race handling via the unique index (409)\n- `routes/api.php` registered with `apiPrefix: ''` in `bootstrap/app.php`, so paths are `/links`, `/links/{code}`, `/r/{code}` — no `/api` prefix, and no rate limiting in the way\n- DB settings come purely from `DB_*` env vars (MySQL at `mysql:3306`, database `bench`); the `.env` sqlite default is overridden by the environment\n- `start.sh` (executable): `php artisan migrate --force` then `exec php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload` in the foreground\n- README section covering startup plus an endpoint reference\n\n**Verified by live HTTP tests**\n- 201 creates (auto and custom codes) returning `{code, url, clicks: 0}` with the URL byte-identical (JSON emitted with `JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES`)\n- 409 duplicate code, 422 for malformed JSON, missing/invalid URL (non-http, no host, relative), and short/long/invalid codes — all with an `error` field\n- 302 redirects with exact `Location` header, clicks incremented exactly once even under 8 parallel requests (1→9), 404 JSON for unknown codes on both lookup and redirect\n- List endpoint returns items in creation order with correct `total`\n- Restart via `start.sh`: migration idempotent (\"Nothing to migrate\"), all rows and click counts survived\n\nPint style checks and the test suite pass, the server is stopped, and I reset the database to an empty schema so the automated test suite starts clean."
  }
